<title>SYRIA: Port conditions update - Syria - Greece - Lloyds.</title>
<headline>Port conditions update - Syria - Greece - Lloyds.</headline>
<text>
<p>Port conditions from Lloyds Shipping Intelligence Service --</p>
<p>SYRIA, Nov 23 - Lattakia and Tartous - Waiting period 24 hours.</p>
<p>GREECE, Dec 4 - Piraeus - Greek port stevedores went on strike last week for an indefinite period over pay.</p>
</text>
